WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.802
Meet Creator Agent, a mobile-first studio that turns creator content into a grounded audience agent.

00:00:05.802 --> 00:00:09.135
Add documents, transcripts, or private video.

00:00:09.135 --> 00:00:11.656
Sources stay private until approved.

00:00:11.656 --> 00:00:15.812
Audience questions are answered from approved excerpts with source citations.

00:00:15.812 --> 00:00:19.947
Creators tune tone, depth, signature phrases, and boundaries.

00:00:19.947 --> 00:00:24.458
Generation stays deterministic and free, or routes to a user-owned agent.

00:00:24.458 --> 00:00:28.583
Built-in load controls model safe service for many simultaneous users.

00:00:28.583 --> 00:00:32.416
Creator Agent: creator-owned knowledge, voice, and routing.
